---
source: crates/aether/tests/steps/cli/help.rs
expression: world.cli.stdout()
---
Usage: aether node directory <FLAGS> <SUBCOMMAND>

Commands:
  publish
  renew
  resolve
  revoke
  search
  sync
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Flags:
      --directory <DIRECTORY>
      --directory-certificate <DIRECTORY_CERTIFICATE>
      --agent-verifying-key <AGENT_VERIFYING_KEY>
  -h, --help                              Print help
